  },
  {
    "id": 4001052010120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "犯人は誰だ！？　って\r\nSNSで盛り上がるタイプのだね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105201/4001052010120"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n若手俳優やアイドルを集めた深夜帯のドラマだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "タイトルは『誰かが、見ている』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "登場人物それぞれが目撃者となり、考え、行動する",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その行動を見た別の人が再び……\r\nという構造を意味しているらしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "002",
