    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105201/4001052010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052010140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『見た』映像は、あくまで目撃者視点……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105201/4001052010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052010150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それぞれが目撃者なら、立場や性格、思い込み、\r\nそれに演出によるミスリードの可能性もある……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105201/4001052010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052010160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そこをあえて打ち出すということは、\r\nかなり複雑なドラマになりそうですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105201/4001052010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。他にも実験がしたいらしく、\r\n役柄の名前は芸名を全てカタカナにしたもの──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
